1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,591
Splish, splash,

2
00:00:01,591 --> 00:00:03,291
bubbles in the tub!

3
00:00:03,591 --> 00:00:07,183
Rub a dub, scrub, scrub, scrub!

4
00:00:07,483 --> 00:00:08,483
Clap, clap!

5
00:00:08,783 --> 00:00:10,772
The bubble bath is ready.

6
00:00:10,772 --> 00:00:12,691
Who is ready for a bath?

7
00:00:15,990 --> 00:00:16,805
Not me!

8
00:00:16,805 --> 00:00:18,760
I like my muddy paws!

9
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:21,249
Pip! You have mud on your ears,

10
00:00:21,249 --> 00:00:22,390
mud on your nose,

11
00:00:22,390 --> 00:00:23,759
and mud on your tail!

12
00:00:24,308 --> 00:00:25,638
But baths are wet.

13
00:00:25,638 --> 00:00:27,982
And I don't like water in my eyes.

14
00:00:29,832 --> 00:00:32,194
I'll be right here with you, Pip,

15
00:00:32,194 --> 00:00:33,375
the whole time.

16
00:00:33,625 --> 00:00:36,586
Let's feel the water with one paw.

17
00:00:37,136 --> 00:00:39,529
Ooh! Is the water hot, or cold,

18
00:00:39,529 --> 00:00:40,656
or just warm?

19
00:00:42,656 --> 00:00:43,718
Just warm!

20
00:00:43,718 --> 00:00:45,271
Like a cosy hug.

21
00:00:47,121 --> 00:00:48,390
In the bath,

22
00:00:48,390 --> 00:00:50,252
we always sit down.

23
00:00:50,502 --> 00:00:52,565
Sit, sit, sit.

24
00:00:53,115 --> 00:00:54,068
I'm sitting!

25
00:00:54,068 --> 00:00:54,767
Hee hee.

26
00:00:54,767 --> 00:00:56,673
The bubbles tickle my nose.

27
00:00:57,223 --> 00:00:58,723
Ah, ah, achoo!

28
00:00:59,273 --> 00:01:00,273
Splash!

29
00:01:01,873 --> 00:01:02,584
Hee hee!

30
00:01:02,584 --> 00:01:03,425
Pip, look!

31
00:01:03,425 --> 00:01:05,042
You have a bubble hat!

32
00:01:05,592 --> 00:01:06,816
It's not a hat.

33
00:01:06,816 --> 00:01:08,380
It's a bubble crown!

34
00:01:08,630 --> 00:01:11,342
I am King Pip of Bubble Land!

35
00:01:11,892 --> 00:01:13,333
Hello, King Pip!

36
00:01:13,333 --> 00:01:15,533
Can you make a royal wave?

37
00:01:18,833 --> 00:01:21,890
Whoa! Big shiny bubbles are floating up!

38
00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:25,094
How many big bubbles can you see?

39
00:01:25,344 --> 00:01:26,690
Count with me!

40
00:01:28,690 --> 00:01:31,229
One, two, three, four, five!

41
00:01:31,479 --> 00:01:33,344
Five big bubbles!

42
00:01:35,194 --> 00:01:37,270
Let's pop them, gently,

43
00:01:37,270 --> 00:01:38,786
with one finger.

44
00:01:39,036 --> 00:01:41,561
Hold up your popping finger!

45
00:01:43,561 --> 00:01:44,676
Pop! Pop!

46
00:01:47,626 --> 00:01:49,045
Two bubbles popped!

47
00:01:49,045 --> 00:01:50,914
How many bubbles are left?

48
00:01:52,914 --> 00:01:54,857
Three! Pop, pop, pop!

49
00:01:58,107 --> 00:01:59,797
Here come the bath toys!

50
00:01:59,797 --> 00:02:01,926
What colour is the little duck?

51
00:02:03,926 --> 00:02:05,983
Yellow! A yellow duck!

52
00:02:07,833 --> 00:02:10,353
And what colour is the boat?

53
00:02:10,603 --> 00:02:12,591
It's like the sky.

54
00:02:14,591 --> 00:02:16,899
Blue! Sail, little boat, sail!

55
00:02:17,449 --> 00:02:18,449
Splish!

56
00:02:20,049 --> 00:02:21,764
And Mama has a cup.

57
00:02:21,764 --> 00:02:23,714
What colour is my cup?

58
00:02:25,714 --> 00:02:27,009
Red! Yellow,

59
00:02:27,009 --> 00:02:28,391
blue and red!

60
00:02:30,241 --> 00:02:33,056
Now, let's wash the mud away.

61
00:02:33,306 --> 00:02:34,870
Where are your ears?

62
00:02:34,870 --> 00:02:36,365
Point to your ears!

63
00:02:38,365 --> 00:02:39,632
Scrub, scrub,

64
00:02:39,632 --> 00:02:41,057
my floppy ears!

65
00:02:43,107 --> 00:02:44,611
Where is your nose?

66
00:02:44,611 --> 00:02:46,456
Can you touch your nose?

67
00:02:48,456 --> 00:02:49,354
Here it is!

68
00:02:49,354 --> 00:02:50,380
Scrub, scrub,

69
00:02:50,380 --> 00:02:51,533
my little nose!

70
00:02:53,383 --> 00:02:54,770
And your tummy,

71
00:02:54,770 --> 00:02:56,080
and your toes!

72
00:02:56,330 --> 00:02:58,810
Can you wiggle your toes?

73
00:03:00,810 --> 00:03:02,034
Wiggle, wiggle!

74
00:03:02,034 --> 00:03:03,734
Hee hee, that tickles!

75
00:03:04,284 --> 00:03:05,536
Now, the rinse.

76
00:03:05,536 --> 00:03:08,458
Tip your head back and close your eyes.

77
00:03:08,708 --> 00:03:11,014
I'll pour so gently.

78
00:03:14,764 --> 00:03:15,748
Eyes closed.

79
00:03:15,748 --> 00:03:16,601
Head back.

80
00:03:16,601 --> 00:03:18,110
No water in my eyes!

81
00:03:18,660 --> 00:03:20,244
Pip, you were so brave!

82
00:03:20,244 --> 00:03:20,975
And look,

83
00:03:20,975 --> 00:03:21,889
no more mud!

84
00:03:23,739 --> 00:03:24,739
Squeak, squeak!

85
00:03:25,039 --> 00:03:27,231
Did that duck say something?

86
00:03:27,481 --> 00:03:29,013
Is that Dotty Duckling?

87
00:03:29,013 --> 00:03:30,250
What do you think?

88
00:03:32,250 --> 00:03:33,381
Quack quack!

89
00:03:33,381 --> 00:03:35,115
I'm right here, Pip!

90
00:03:36,965 --> 00:03:38,674
That's a toy duck!

91
00:03:38,674 --> 00:03:40,138
It goes squeak.

92
00:03:40,388 --> 00:03:42,965
Real ducks go quack!

93
00:03:43,515 --> 00:03:44,059
Ha ha!

94
00:03:44,059 --> 00:03:45,026
Hello, Dotty!

95
00:03:45,026 --> 00:03:47,323
Can you say quack like a real duck?

96
00:03:49,323 --> 00:03:51,058
Ducks love water too!

97
00:03:51,058 --> 00:03:53,804
Can I sing your bath song with you?

98
00:03:55,654 --> 00:03:57,385
The Bubble Bath Song!

99
00:03:57,385 --> 00:03:58,538
Sing with us!

100
00:03:59,338 --> 00:04:00,602
Splish, splash,

101
00:04:00,602 --> 00:04:02,146
bubbles in the tub!

102
00:04:02,546 --> 00:04:05,854
Rub a dub, scrub, scrub, scrub!

103
00:04:06,454 --> 00:04:07,836
Wash your ears,

104
00:04:07,836 --> 00:04:09,525
and wash your nose.

105
00:04:09,775 --> 00:04:10,680
Point!

106
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:13,420
Wash your tummy,

107
00:04:13,420 --> 00:04:14,618
and your toes!

108
00:04:14,868 --> 00:04:15,734
Wiggle!

109
00:04:18,434 --> 00:04:21,472
Pop the bubbles, one, two, three!

110
00:04:21,872 --> 00:04:22,972
Pop, pop, pop!

111
00:04:23,272 --> 00:04:24,546
Clean and happy,

112
00:04:24,546 --> 00:04:25,484
look at me!

113
00:04:26,084 --> 00:04:27,475
Splish, splash,

114
00:04:27,475 --> 00:04:29,174
bubbles in the tub!

115
00:04:29,574 --> 00:04:32,517
Rub a dub, scrub, scrub, scrub!

116
00:04:34,817 --> 00:04:35,857
All done!

117
00:04:35,857 --> 00:04:37,851
Out we come, slowly.

118
00:04:38,101 --> 00:04:39,269
Hold my paw.

119
00:04:39,269 --> 00:04:41,450
Here's your fluffy towel.

120
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:44,539
I'm warm and clean and fluffy!

121
00:04:44,789 --> 00:04:46,327
Baths are fun!

122
00:04:46,877 --> 00:04:49,358
Can you shake like a wet puppy?

123
00:04:49,608 --> 00:04:51,281
Shake, shake, shake!

124
00:04:54,581 --> 00:04:55,940
Quack! Hee hee!

125
00:04:55,940 --> 00:04:57,677
Now I'm all wet too!

126
00:04:59,527 --> 00:05:00,668
One more time!

127
00:05:00,668 --> 00:05:02,546
Scrub your tummy with me!

128
00:05:02,796 --> 00:05:04,060
Splish, splash,

129
00:05:04,060 --> 00:05:05,604
bubbles in the tub!

130
00:05:05,854 --> 00:05:08,796
Rub a dub, scrub, scrub, scrub!

131
00:05:09,596 --> 00:05:13,464
Share with a friend and subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

132
00:05:14,064 --> 00:05:14,966
Next time,

133
00:05:14,966 --> 00:05:17,602
Pip Puppy finds a cosy night light!

134
00:05:18,202 --> 00:05:19,724
Woof! Bye bye, friends!

135
00:05:19,724 --> 00:05:22,125
See you next time on Honey Bunny Kidz!

136
00:05:24,725 --> 00:05:26,182
All clean and cosy!

137
00:05:26,182 --> 00:05:28,302
Look, I'm in my moon pajamas!

138
00:05:28,852 --> 00:05:31,627
What do we do after bath time?

139
00:05:31,877 --> 00:05:33,531
Can you guess?

140
00:05:35,531 --> 00:05:38,169
Yes! We get ready for bed.

141
00:05:38,419 --> 00:05:41,155
Let's take a big, slow breath.

142
00:05:41,405 --> 00:05:42,688
Breathe in...

143
00:05:42,688 --> 00:05:43,570
and out.

144
00:05:45,170 --> 00:05:47,728
Yay! It's Pip and the Night Light.

145
00:05:47,978 --> 00:05:49,132
Let's watch!

146
00:05:50,382 --> 00:05:52,574
Psst! What glows at night?

147
00:05:52,824 --> 00:05:54,228
Can you guess?

148
00:05:56,228 --> 00:05:59,161
Let's find out at our sleepover, Pip!

149
00:05:59,711 --> 00:06:01,610
My very first sleepover!

150
00:06:01,610 --> 00:06:02,595
Woof, woof!

151
00:06:04,445 --> 00:06:05,629
Pajamas on.

152
00:06:05,629 --> 00:06:07,067
Teeth brushed.

153
00:06:07,317 --> 00:06:09,768
Time for bed, little ones.

154
00:06:10,318 --> 00:06:11,991
Night night, lamp!

155
00:06:12,541 --> 00:06:13,141
Click!

156
00:06:14,741 --> 00:06:16,933
Oh! It's very dark now.

157
00:06:17,483 --> 00:06:20,291
Hmm. I'm not sure I like the dark.

158
00:06:20,841 --> 00:06:22,387
That's okay, Pip.

159
00:06:22,387 --> 00:06:23,778
I'm right here.

160
00:06:24,028 --> 00:06:27,208
Let's look for the cosy lights of the night!

161
00:06:29,058 --> 00:06:29,876
Ooh, look!

162
00:06:29,876 --> 00:06:32,961
A big shape on the wall, with long, long ears!

163
00:06:33,211 --> 00:06:34,615
Who could it be?

164
00:06:36,615 --> 00:06:37,375
It's me!

165
00:06:37,375 --> 00:06:38,619
It's my shadow!

166
00:06:38,619 --> 00:06:39,863
Wiggle, wiggle!

167
00:06:41,713 --> 00:06:42,505
My turn!

168
00:06:42,505 --> 00:06:44,809
Floppy ears and a waggy tail.

169
00:06:45,059 --> 00:06:46,675
Who is this shadow?

170
00:06:48,675 --> 00:06:49,592
It's Pip!

171
00:06:49,592 --> 00:06:50,663
Woof, woof!

172
00:06:51,213 --> 00:06:53,694
Shadows are silly, not scary!

173
00:06:55,544 --> 00:06:57,368
Pip, look out the window!

174
00:06:57,368 --> 00:06:59,126
Who is glowing up there?

175
00:07:01,126 --> 00:07:02,246
Hello, Pip!

176
00:07:02,246 --> 00:07:03,525
I'm the Moon.

177
00:07:03,525 --> 00:07:04,884
I glow softly,

178
00:07:04,884 --> 00:07:06,322
all night long.

179
00:07:06,872 --> 00:07:07,911
Hello, Moon!

180
00:07:07,911 --> 00:07:09,295
You look so cosy.

181
00:07:11,145 --> 00:07:13,131
What shape am I tonight?

182
00:07:13,131 --> 00:07:15,998
Draw it in the air with your finger!

183
00:07:17,998 --> 00:07:18,831
A circle!

184
00:07:18,831 --> 00:07:20,844
Round and round and round!

185
00:07:22,694 --> 00:07:25,685
Count my stars with me, Pip!

186
00:07:26,235 --> 00:07:27,004
One!

187
00:07:28,004 --> 00:07:28,735
Two!

188
00:07:31,035 --> 00:07:31,881
Three!

189
00:07:32,881 --> 00:07:33,688
Four!

190
00:07:35,988 --> 00:07:37,494
And one more,

191
00:07:37,494 --> 00:07:38,905
way up high!

192
00:07:39,155 --> 00:07:42,513
How many stars are there now?

193
00:07:44,513 --> 00:07:47,109
Five! Five twinkly stars!

194
00:07:48,959 --> 00:07:52,325
Let's make twinkle fingers, like stars!

195
00:07:52,575 --> 00:07:55,410
Open, close, open, close!

196
00:07:57,410 --> 00:07:58,788
Twinkle, twinkle!

197
00:07:58,788 --> 00:08:00,717
My paws are little stars!

198
00:08:02,567 --> 00:08:04,367
Hoo... hoo...

199
00:08:04,667 --> 00:08:05,741
What was that?

200
00:08:05,741 --> 00:08:07,571
Who says hoo-hoo at night?

201
00:08:09,571 --> 00:08:12,144
Let's peek outside together.

202
00:08:12,394 --> 00:08:14,457
Stay close to me.

203
00:08:16,307 --> 00:08:19,251
Hoo-hoo! Good evening, Pip!

204
00:08:19,501 --> 00:08:21,534
It's me, Ollie Owl!

205
00:08:22,084 --> 00:08:23,834
Ollie! You're awake?

206
00:08:24,384 --> 00:08:26,478
Owls are awake at night.

207
00:08:26,478 --> 00:08:28,262
We sleep in the day!

208
00:08:30,112 --> 00:08:33,439
Look! Little lights are blinking in the grass.

209
00:08:33,689 --> 00:08:35,382
Blink, blink!

210
00:08:35,932 --> 00:08:37,744
Those are fireflies!

211
00:08:37,744 --> 00:08:39,320
Their tails glow.

212
00:08:39,570 --> 00:08:41,626
What colour is their light?

213
00:08:43,626 --> 00:08:46,087
Yellow! A soft yellow glow!

214
00:08:47,937 --> 00:08:50,951
Can I tell you a secret, Pip?

215
00:08:51,201 --> 00:08:51,995
The big,

216
00:08:51,995 --> 00:08:55,313
bright day is too sunny for my sleepy eyes!

217
00:08:55,863 --> 00:08:58,729
Really? You feel a little unsure too?

218
00:08:59,279 --> 00:09:02,221
Yes! So I snuggle in my cosy tree,

219
00:09:02,221 --> 00:09:04,209
and then I feel brave.

220
00:09:04,759 --> 00:09:06,476
I can find my cosy too!

221
00:09:06,476 --> 00:09:07,797
Thank you, Ollie!

222
00:09:09,647 --> 00:09:12,730
I have a little something for you, Pip.

223
00:09:12,980 --> 00:09:14,708
A star night light,

224
00:09:14,708 --> 00:09:15,965
all your own.

225
00:09:16,515 --> 00:09:17,817
Can I turn it on?

226
00:09:17,817 --> 00:09:19,380
Ready? Count with me.

227
00:09:19,630 --> 00:09:21,284
One, two, three!

228
00:09:23,284 --> 00:09:23,884
Click!

229
00:09:25,484 --> 00:09:27,256
Wow! My star is glowing!

230
00:09:27,256 --> 00:09:29,619
The dark feels soft and cosy now.

231
00:09:30,169 --> 00:09:32,620
Now you have a little star inside,

232
00:09:32,620 --> 00:09:34,342
and a big moon outside!

233
00:09:36,192 --> 00:09:38,442
I made a Night Light Song!

234
00:09:38,692 --> 00:09:40,211
Sing it with me!

235
00:09:40,761 --> 00:09:41,704
Glow, glow,

236
00:09:41,704 --> 00:09:43,184
little night light.

237
00:09:43,434 --> 00:09:44,809
Soft and yellow,

238
00:09:44,809 --> 00:09:46,184
warm and bright.

239
00:09:46,734 --> 00:09:48,145
Moon is round,

240
00:09:48,145 --> 00:09:49,805
and stars say hi.

241
00:09:50,055 --> 00:09:51,561
Fireflies blink,

242
00:09:51,561 --> 00:09:53,067
and owls fly by.

243
00:09:53,617 --> 00:09:54,559
Glow, glow,

244
00:09:54,559 --> 00:09:56,040
little night light.

245
00:09:56,290 --> 00:09:59,001
Cosy, cosy, sleepy night.

246
00:10:00,901 --> 00:10:03,571
Let's do sleepy puppy breaths.

247
00:10:03,821 --> 00:10:05,497
Breathe in slowly,

248
00:10:05,497 --> 00:10:07,972
like smelling a warm cookie.

249
00:10:09,972 --> 00:10:11,404
And breathe out,

250
00:10:11,404 --> 00:10:13,515
like blowing a dandelion.

251
00:10:13,765 --> 00:10:15,343
Whoosh.

252
00:10:17,343 --> 00:10:19,031
Stretch your arms up,

253
00:10:19,031 --> 00:10:20,086
like a star.

254
00:10:20,336 --> 00:10:22,016
Now curl up small,

255
00:10:22,016 --> 00:10:23,855
like a sleepy puppy.

256
00:10:25,855 --> 00:10:28,163
Yawn. I'm a sleepy puppy.

257
00:10:30,013 --> 00:10:31,184
Goodnight, Moon.

258
00:10:31,184 --> 00:10:32,417
Goodnight, Ollie.

259
00:10:32,667 --> 00:10:34,936
Goodnight, little night light.

260
00:10:35,486 --> 00:10:36,992
Goodnight, Pip.

261
00:10:36,992 --> 00:10:39,334
I'll glow all night long.

262
00:10:39,884 --> 00:10:42,345
Can you whisper goodnight too?

263
00:10:45,645 --> 00:10:46,816
One more time!

264
00:10:46,816 --> 00:10:49,088
Make twinkle fingers and sing!

265
00:10:49,338 --> 00:10:50,280
Glow, glow,

266
00:10:50,280 --> 00:10:51,761
little night light.

267
00:10:52,011 --> 00:10:54,722
Cosy, cosy, sleepy night.

268
00:10:55,522 --> 00:10:59,390
Share with a friend and subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

269
00:10:59,990 --> 00:11:00,910
Next time,

270
00:11:00,910 --> 00:11:03,033
Pip Puppy has a chilly day,

271
00:11:03,033 --> 00:11:04,731
and a big, big achoo!

272
00:11:05,331 --> 00:11:06,938
Woof! Goodnight, friends!

273
00:11:06,938 --> 00:11:09,292
See you next time on Honey Bunny Kidz!

274
00:11:11,892 --> 00:11:14,180
That's all for now, friends!

275
00:11:14,430 --> 00:11:16,608
Come back soon for more stories

276
00:11:16,608 --> 00:11:18,722
and songs on Honey Bunny Kidz.

277
00:11:18,972 --> 00:11:20,670
Bye bye!
